===Notes===
*Although Steamsaws and steamguns can be selected the attempt fails without a cooldown; the sentry currently isn't programmed to summon with {{t|Steam Pool}}.
*The weapon doesn't actually drop to the ground in the current version. When the sentry dies or its time runs out, the weapon returns to your inventory.
*The duration is rounded down.
*Weapons the sentry can be made from, by talent level (item ranks are listed on [[Rank]] or colored cheatsheet below):
**Any level: no ego, '''{{color|#00FF80|lesser egos}}'''
**Level 3: '''{{color|#0080FF|one greater ego}}''', '''{{color|#FA8072|rare}}'''
**Level 5: '''{{color|#8d55ff|two greater egos}}''', '''{{color|#FA8072|rare}}''' (with a greater ego), '''{{color|#FF7700|random artifacts}}''', '''{{color|#FFD700|artifacts}}'''